%% US-322: NOSTR Backup and Recovery - Data Flow Diagram
%% This diagram shows how data flows through the backup and recovery process

sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant UI as Backup Dialog
    participant Service as NOSTRBackupService
    participant Encryption as BackupEncryptionService
    participant KeyMgmt as KeyManagementService
    participant Storage as Storage Layer

    Note over User,Storage: Backup Creation Flow

    User->>UI: Initiate Backup
    UI->>User: Select Content Type
    User->>UI: Choose (Keys/Events/Config/Complete)
    UI->>User: Enter Password
    User->>UI: Provide Strong Password

    UI->>Service: createBackup(password, contentType)

    Service->>KeyMgmt: listKeys()
    KeyMgmt-->>Service: [KeyPairs]

    Service->>Service: collectBackupData()
    Note over Service: Collect keys, events,<br/>configuration

    Service->>Service: JSON.stringify(data)
    Service->>Service: calculateChecksum(json)

    Service->>Encryption: encryptBackup(json, password)
    Note over Encryption: AES-256-GCM<br/>PBKDF2 100,000 iterations

    Encryption-->>Service: encryptedBackup

    Service->>Service: createBackupFile()
    Service->>Storage: saveToHistory()
    Service->>UI: {file, downloadUrl}

    UI->>User: Download Backup File

    Note over User,Storage: Restore Flow

    User->>UI: Upload Backup File
    UI->>Service: verifyBackup(file, password)

    Service->>Service: validateStructure()
    Service->>Encryption: decryptBackup(file, password)
    Encryption-->>Service: decryptedJson
    Service->>Service: verifyChecksum()

    Service-->>UI: verificationResult

    UI->>User: Show Verification Status
    User->>UI: Confirm Restore Options
    UI->>Service: restoreBackup(file, password, options)

    Service->>Encryption: decryptBackup(file, password)
    Encryption-->>Service: backupData

    Service->>KeyMgmt: importKey(keyData)
    KeyMgmt-->>Service: importedKey

    Service->>Service: verifyRestoration()
    Service->>KeyMgmt: signEvent(testEvent)
    KeyMgmt-->>Service: signedEvent
    Service->>KeyMgmt: verifyEventSignature(signedEvent)
    KeyMgmt-->>Service: true

    Service-->>UI: recoveryResult
    UI->>User: Show Success/Errors
